url: 'https://pablogila.github.io/qrotor'
repository: 'https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19535466'
abstract: >-
  QRotor is a Python package used to study molecular
  rotations, such as those of methyl and amine groups. It
  can calculate their quantum energy levels and
  wavefunctions, along with excitations and tunnel
  splittings.
